{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《玫瑰戰爭》第1集即迎來震撼開局，夏無雙(楊茜堯飾)為追查摯友關子盈(陳自瑤飾)7年前離奇失蹤傳已身亡背後真相，強勢重返娛樂圈。她以法國片廠代表身分拉攏昔日4位好姊妹重聚並參與綜藝節目錄影，表面寒暄背後卻暗藏殺機。節目現場頻生意外令人心惶惶，一場精心策劃7年復仇風暴已經悄悄逼近眾人身邊。陳自瑤飾演關子盈 連...</p>\n<p> 《玫瑰戰爭》第1集即迎來震撼開局，夏無雙(楊茜堯飾)為追查摯友關子盈(陳自瑤飾)7年前離奇失蹤傳已身亡背後真相，強勢重返娛樂圈。她以法國片廠代表身分拉攏昔日4位好姊妹重聚並參與綜藝節目錄影，表面寒暄背後卻暗藏殺機。節目現場頻生意外令人心惶惶，一場精心策劃7年復仇風暴已經悄悄逼近眾人身邊。</p>\n<h2>陳自瑤飾演關子盈 連環不幸被出賣 離奇失蹤真相成謎</h2>\n<p>關子盈(陳自瑤飾)7年前曾經榮獲影后殊榮，卻在事業如日中天之際離奇失蹤傳已身亡。7年過去，摯友從她遺留下來那本日記本中，驚悉這位當紅女星當年疑似遭到同公司好姊妹殘酷背叛與無情加害！</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179422274135115012_14308199116af1aa9606d97.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"DSC07460  拷贝.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179422274135115012_14308199116af1aa9606d97.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>楊茜堯睇日記發現好姐妹被謀害（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>關子盈高峰滑落慘遭好姐妹背叛放陰招全方位謀害</h2>\n<p>雖然她在第1集未有太多戲份，但其悲慘遭遇與留下來那本日記卻成為推動整個復仇計劃最核心關鍵，當中包括（1）「片場槍傷」導致受傷不能接拍重頭戲，（2）其後再被設局屈偷食人夫做小三，在傳媒面前慘被人格謀殺，（3）連環不幸第三件事係慘遭落藥迷姦，背後真兇已經寫在日記，楊茜堯決定向舊公司幾位花旦逐一埋手代姐妹報仇！</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179422274336639104_3965344266af1aa989b2a5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bb8be2c1-df97-48a8-82f8-2dc07050db0f.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179422274336639104_3965344266af1aa989b2a5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>影后上位無好結果，人人都想害死關子盈（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179422274909098472_1352718606af1aa9d99c89.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"2cfb09a0-2082-4ee8-b704-e573144df7e3.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179422274909098472_1352718606af1aa9d99c89.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>有個八婆喺道具槍落手腳，連累陳自瑤身受重傷未能接拍公司重頭作 ！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179422275166316810_20660412686af1aaa005341.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6779ba6c-bd83-456c-89f9-5889550cbc2a.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179422275166316810_20660412686af1aaa005341.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>熟人放料，好人好姐慘被屈做小三，車震被記者直擊，慘被傳媒寫衰，被塑造成「破壞別人家庭」狐狸精！陳自瑤今次挑戰演技！ （圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179422275327487340_3600733916af1aaa196408.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"4bb9cafc-c867-4a13-b172-b1dc60086491.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179422275327487340_3600733916af1aaa196408.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>好嬲好嬲，跟住人間蒸發！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179422275537273410_7844265796af1aaa3e441a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"da303838-d663-425b-b312-c569954d0fdb.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179422275537273410_7844265796af1aaa3e441a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>被熟人落藥，痛不欲生！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>楊茜堯化身夏無雙展開強勢復仇大計</h2>\n<p>夏無雙(楊茜堯飾)與已故影后關子盈識於微時，在得知摯友遭遇後化悲痛為復仇利刃。她以合拍經典電影《玫瑰》作為誘餌，假借法國片廠亞太區代表身分強勢回歸，並答應擔任4位昔日好姊妹主持綜藝節目嘉賓。錄影期間她步步為營，表面上與眾人重拾舊日情誼，實則暗中佈局挑起女人之間互相猜忌，誓要令當年作賊心虛加害者付出沉重代價。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179422275776780785_4398198786af1aaa6089f1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"L1053106.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179422275776780785_4398198786af1aaa6089f1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳自瑤生死未卜屍首無存，楊茜堯以遺產繼承人身份回港報仇（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>陳豪飾演陳雲生面臨娛樂圈權力洗牌</h2>\n<p>身為天誠娛樂公司老闆，陳雲生(陳豪飾)在娛樂圈擁有呼風喚雨龐大勢力。面對夏無雙(楊茜堯飾)提出重拍經典電影《玫瑰》合作方案，他展現出深不可測商人本色。在第1集劇情中他看似置身事外，但身為掌控資本權力核心人物，他與7年前影后離奇失蹤傳已身亡事件絕對有著千絲萬縷關係，未來他將成為這場復仇佈局中被重點針對目標。</p>\n<h2>鄺潔楹演林安安捲入好姊妹互相撕殺</h2>\n<p>林安安(鄺潔楹飾)作為當年4位好姊妹之一，如今與另外3人共同主持綜藝節目。在節目錄影期間面對昔日舊友突然現身，她與其他3人皆表現出作賊心虛恐慌情緒。隨着現場錄影不斷發生離奇意外，有人存心要令她們自揭瘡疤，林安安(鄺潔楹飾)內心防線開始動搖，這群表面光鮮亮麗女星背後隱藏最不堪人性陰暗面正被一步步猛烈撕開。</p>\n<h2>玫瑰戰爭第2集預告意外頻生惹猜測</h2>\n<p>明晚播出《玫瑰戰爭》第2集將迎來更多激烈衝突，綜藝節目錄影期間意外頻生令眾女直指是夏無雙(楊茜堯飾)從中作梗。夏無雙(楊茜堯飾)為力證清白不惜當眾否認更因此受傷，而當年舊愛李德龍(馬國明飾)亦開始察覺事態並不尋常。眾女其後更收到署名神秘信封，拍攝現場甚至發生道具槍嚴重意外，網民紛紛留言表示「復仇劇情真係好刺激」。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179416092536715521_9502416936af0b91e9fa88.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179416092536715521_9502416936af0b91e9fa88.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳豪飾演影視集團大老闆（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179416091190275207_8364353596af0b910680c9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179416091190275207_8364353596af0b910680c9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179416091839929340_12880564266af0b916cf7b8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179416091839929340_12880564266af0b916cf7b8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179416093368213976_15059759536af0b92625834.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179416093368213976_15059759536af0b92625834.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳自瑤雖然第一集就因為失蹤7年被宣告死亡，但戲份絕對不止於第一集，多幕回憶戲份會將其悲慘過去慢慢披露！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T11:22:36.732958+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1853,"images":11,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T11:12:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:16:34.066163+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T11:16:34.066163+00:00","content_hash":"24827dd10d3ddceafac0f71dfaa69548da70ed6357be93429084b504247b06f4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}